  "prefLabel": "Ed 1114.20 Photography and Audio or Audio-Visual Recording",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1114.20 Photography and Audio or Audio-Visual Recording.\n\n(a) Each private provider of special education or other non-LEA program shall have written policies and procedures regarding the photographing and audio or audio-visual recordings of children in care.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
